# CREDITS — The Mend

A 40-second film in the One-line Drawing style, made entirely in code.
The weaver, the thread and the blanket are invented: no real person, brand or place is portrayed.

## Voice
Speech synthesis: Kokoro (kokoro-onnx), voice `af_heart`, English. Model and engine
are released under the licences of the kokoro-onnx project
(https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Offline synthesis.

## Music
Original score for solo violin, written for this film (`music/score.py`).
One pizzicato note at the handoff; everything else is arco.

Samples (CC0 1.0): VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios /
Sam Gossner) — solo violin, arco and pizzicato.

