## Picture
Every frame is drawn with this film's line engine (`engine/`). Paper, ink, pen shadow
and hand shadows are generated in the page. No stock footage, no photographs,
no third-party images.

## Sound effects
All foley is synthesised for this film (`mix.py`): pen on paper, fibre ticks,
the blot, the handoff rub, and a quiet paper-room tone.
